p/go/closeout-plan-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/delivery-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/effective-governance-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/flat-spec-amendments-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/followup-candidates-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/governance-waits-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/governed-effects-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/legacy-contract-cutoffs-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/migrate-dryrun-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/multi-repo-agent-context-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/phase-readiness-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/public-claims-provenance-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/release-version-source-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/review-assurance-disclosure-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/review-attribution-roles-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/spec-surface-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/state-attention-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/typed-diagnostics-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/usage-adjudication-reachability, reachability:pose-mcp/go/validate-jobs-reachability, unit:pose-mcp/go/test\n[WARN] unmapped review component path:.pose/specs/2026-11-23-pose-review-declared-threat-model.md\n[WARN] unmapped review component path:POSE.md\n[WARN] unmapped review component path:locales/pt-BR/POSE.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
